                    "id": "AID-D-005.001",
                    "comparison": "AID-D-005.002 owns rule engineering and deployment; AID-D-005.001 owns generation, normalization, transport, and retention of the input telemetry.\nA rule cannot establish coverage when its required event population is absent or malformed."
