                          "id": "AID-D-005.008",
                          "comparison": "AID-D-005.003 is analyst-led exploratory hunting for unknown or weakly signaled threats; AID-D-005.008 is a bounded read-only agent that prepares evidence for already queued alerts.\nThreat hunting starts from a hypothesis, while alert triage starts from a specific finding and cannot expand into autonomous response."
