                    "description": "Monitor registration, update, revocation, lookup, and resolution telemetry from applicable agent registries and name-resolution services to detect registry poisoning indicators, Sybil-style namespace abuse, directory reconnaissance, issuer or credential churn, and abnormal not-found or version-mismatch outcomes. Agent Name Service (ANS) is a named implementation driver and example, not the applicability boundary.",
