                          "id": "AID-D-005.003",
                          "comparison": "AID-D-005.008 triages a specific existing alert under a read-only query allowlist; AID-D-005.003 performs hypothesis-driven exploration for threats that may not have triggered an alert.\nTriage is queue-oriented evidence preparation, while hunting is open-ended investigation."
