                            "howTo": "<h5>Production implementation</h5><p>Maintain durable event-time state and high-water marks; measure declared continuity, source/role changes, turn cadence, barge-in, context switches and modality dropout for every finalized turn/window; preserve late/revised event handling; and emit exact deviation evidence. The detector does not authenticate a person, restore a baseline after attacker-controlled healthy events, or terminate a session.</p><h5>Independent verification</h5><p>An independent verifier reconstructs sessions from the append-only event ledger, replays normal, source-change, dropout, barge-in, late-event, restart and state-corruption fixtures, recomputes windows and thresholds, and reconciles every eligible session and finalized turn.</p>"
