                  "comparison": "AID-D-017 measures service-level speed and investigation coverage from observation through triage; AID-D-005.010 measures whether sensors and the telemetry pipeline remain healthy and complete.\nHealthy telemetry is necessary but does not prove alerts are timely, acknowledged, or investigated."
